---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="blueprint" class="bg-surface py-20 md:py-32 border-y border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:b1">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-20" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bsy">
      <h2 class="reveal text-h2 font-black mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:xgfd2m">THE 3-STAGE TRUCK <span class="text-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenvq">LITIGATION PROCESS</span></h2>
      <p class="reveal reveal-delay-1 text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:bdgnmk">How we secure fleet telemetry and force corporate insurance payouts.</p>
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgt">
        <a href="/litigation-process" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors group" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:2vya0i">
          See Our Litigation Process
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-32" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bsx">
      <!-- Stage 1 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bsw">
        <div class="reveal-left" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bsa">
          <div class="text-6xl font-black font-display text-primary/20 mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs9">01</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black font-display mb-6 tracking-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:mw9rov">BLACK BOX & ELD TELEMETRY SEIZURE</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:bdgnml">
            We immediately file federal spoliation letters to preserve the tractor's Event Data Recorder (EDR) and Electronic Logging Device (ELD) data. This secures speed, engine brake application, and hours-of-service compliance before dispatch teams can overwrite the storage.
          </p>
          <div class="p-6 bg-background border border-border font-mono text-xs space-y-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs8">
            <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-border/50 pb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs7">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenv4">ELD_DATA_LOG_094</span>
              <span class="text-success font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenv3">STATUS: SECURED</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs6">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenv2">DRIVE_TIME:</span>
              <span class="text-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenv1">14.2 HRS (VIOLATION)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs5">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenv0">BRAKE_INIT:</span>
              <span class="text-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:qjenuz">0.0 SEC (FATIGUE CONFIRMED)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2 text-primary uppercase font-bold text-[10px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs4">Critical Path: Federal Safety Violation Detected</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-right aspect-video border-2 border-border overflow-hidden relative" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs3">
          <img 
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/34902065/pexels-photo-34902065.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" 
            alt="Semi truck dashboard data logs" 
            class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale brightness-75"
            loading="lazy" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:yugg4h" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary/20 to-transparent" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs2"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 2 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bs1">
        <div class="reveal-right lg:order-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7brf">
          <div class="text-6xl font-black font-display text-primary/20 mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bre">02</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black font-display mb-6 tracking-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:mw9row">FLEET CARRIER REGULATORY AUDIT</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:bdgnmm">
            We audit the truck company's historical SMS safety profile, carrier maintenance logs, driver medical certifications, and substance screening histories. We uncover the systemic safety shortcuts that led directly to Route 18 and Turnpike collisions.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7brd">
            <div class="p-4 bg-background border border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7brc">
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-muted-foreground uppercase" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7brb">SMS Rating</div>
              <div class="text-2xl font-black font-display text-error" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7bra">CRITICAL</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-background border border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7br9">
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-muted-foreground uppercase" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7br8">Maint. Logs</div>
              <div class="text-2xl font-black font-display text-error" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7br7">DEFICIENT</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-left lg:order-1 aspect-video border-2 border-border overflow-hidden relative" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:wc7br6">
          <img 
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/18468412/pexels-photo-18468412.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" 
            alt="Damaged commercial semi truck bumper" 
            class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale brightness-75"
            loading="lazy" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:yugg4g" />
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-error text-white text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-1 uppercase" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxh2">Violation Flag</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 3 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxh1">
        <div class="reveal-left" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxh0">
          <div class="text-6xl font-black font-display text-primary/20 mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgz">03</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black font-display mb-6 tracking-tight" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:mw9rox">KINETIC JURY PRESENTATION</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:bdgnmn">
            We transform cold technical logs into high-fidelity 3D reconstruction animations. We show New Jersey juries exactly how a massive multi-ton commercial vehicle failed to control its lane, visually isolating the driver’s negligence.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgy">
            <div class="px-4 py-2 border border-primary text-primary text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgx">3D Physics Model</div>
            <div class="px-4 py-2 border border-border text-muted-foreground text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgw">Impact Map</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-right aspect-video border-2 border-border overflow-hidden relative" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgv">
          <img 
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/797570/pexels-photo-797570.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" 
            alt="Accident reconstruction expert laser scanner" 
            class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale brightness-75"
            loading="lazy" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:yugg4f" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgu">
             <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary flex items-center justify-center rounded-full hover:scale-110 transition-transform cursor-pointer" data-ps="src/components/home/Blueprint.astro:lnxxgt">
               <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-foreground ml-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M4.516 7.548c0.436-0.446 1.043-0.481 1.576 0l3.908 3.747 3.908-3.747c0.533-0.481 1.141-0.446 1.574 0 0.436 0.445 0.408 1.197 0 1.615l-4.695 4.502c-0.269 0.257-0.627 0.386-0.985 0.386s-0.716-0.129-0.985-0.386l-4.695-4.502c-0.408-0.418-0.436-1.17 0-1.615z" transform="rotate(-90 10 10)"/></svg>
             </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
